            <ArticleTitle>[Occurrence of correlation between occurrence of genital tract candidiasis in young girls and some subjective and objective examination parameters].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>336-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors tried to find the correlation between the occurrence of genital tract candidiasis in adolescents and some subjective and objective examination parameters. The highest correlation rates were found for pudendal pruritus, lower abdominal pains and early applied antibiotic therapy material: 188 adolescent girls.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
